1
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:14,999
[Music] My name is Jismadon. I work as a staff nurse in Ireland. My home is

2
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:23,999
here in Kannur. This is my dad, Jose. We are members of the Chemmanthotty parish. I came to Kreupasanam for the first time in April 2019.

3
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:28,999
I came in April, that day I came with my mom. My mom had

4
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:34,999
come to Kreupasanam earlier and had already taken the Covenant in February. The reason I came with my mom that day was because

5
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:39,999
she was feeding small children here after six months. And my baby had also just turned six months.

6
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:46,999
So I had come with my mom to feed my baby. I came that day and went back. At that time, I was

7
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:51,999
working in Saudi Arabia. But I had not yet taken the Covenant. For every

8
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:58,999
need I had, whenever I came, I would always put in a light prayer request and ask for prayer support.

9
00:00:59,000 --> 00:01:06,999
All the things I requested, Mother Mary granted for me. First, I want to share the testimonies that happened before I took the Covenant.

10
00:01:07,000 --> 00:01:12,999
The first is about my OET exam.

11
00:01:13,000 --> 00:01:18,999
What I want to share first is about the exam I wrote. When I was going to write the OET exam for the second time,

12
00:01:19,000 --> 00:01:22,999
I wore a blessed medal of Mother Mary. Not the Covenant medal —

13
00:01:23,000 --> 00:01:28,999
just a normal blessed medal. Before the exam, I was continuously praying the Creed.

14
00:01:29,000 --> 00:01:35,999
Even though my mom was back home, she lit a candle and prayed the Creed for me.

15
00:01:36,000 --> 00:01:40,999
My exam was extremely difficult. Especially the first part of Listening — anyone who's taken the OET will know.

16
00:01:41,000 --> 00:01:43,999
The first part was a total blank for me.

17
00:01:44,000 --> 00:01:49,999
I didn’t write even a single word. At that moment, I realized that I was going to fail this exam no matter what.

18
00:01:50,000 --> 00:01:56,999
But the remaining modules were surprisingly very easy for me. When the result came, the section I thought I’d fail

19
00:01:57,000 --> 00:02:03,999
was actually the one I passed, and in two other subjects which I thought were easy, I failed. In both of those

20
00:02:04,000 --> 00:02:09,999
I got a score of 330. It was in Speaking and Reading

21
00:02:10,000 --> 00:02:15,999
that my score was low. Again, I prayed to Mother Mary, saying, "Mother, whichever country You wish

22
00:02:16,000 --> 00:02:21,999
for me to go and work in, please grant me the score needed for that. I can't write this exam again." At that

23
00:02:22,000 --> 00:02:26,999
time, I was pregnant for the second time. So I really couldn’t write the exam again. I asked,

24
00:02:27,000 --> 00:02:32,999
"Mother, please show me clearly which one I should give for re-evaluation." And so I prayed to Mother Mary and gave

25
00:02:33,000 --> 00:02:37,999
my Speaking for re-evaluation. Everyone told me not to do it, that I wouldn’t get the result, because my score was only 330.

26
00:02:38,000 --> 00:02:43,999
Everyone told me I would never get it, but I said, “I believe Mother Mary is with me,” and I submitted it. When the result

27
00:02:44,000 --> 00:02:50,999
came, I got a score of 350. That’s how I received the score required for Ireland. Then the next hurdle was my

28
00:02:51,000 --> 00:02:56,999
NMBI (Nursing and Midwifery Board of Ireland) registration. I faced a lot of obstacles in that process. Still, I held on tightly to Mother Mary and

29
00:02:57,000 --> 00:03:03,999
prayed. Because my experience was from Saudi, none of the paperwork from there was being accepted. The application I submitted

30
00:03:04,000 --> 00:03:08,999
got rejected. The very day it was rejected, while I was still praying to Mother Mary,

31
00:03:09,000 --> 00:03:13,999
I received a message from Saudi. One of the supervisors from our hospital

32
00:03:14,000 --> 00:03:19,999
told me that they could write an employment letter for me. So, I submitted that employment letter, and

33
00:03:20,000 --> 00:03:24,999
my NMBI registration was successful. My next desire was to work in an HSE hospital

34
00:03:25,000 --> 00:03:29,999
because I had NICU experience. But I wasn't even getting a single interview call.

35
00:03:30,000 --> 00:03:34,999
Then everyone around me started saying that I won’t get into pediatrics or anything like that anymore,

36
00:03:35,000 --> 00:03:39,999
and that I should just attend an interview at a nursing home and try to go abroad somehow. So, as they said,

37
00:03:40,000 --> 00:03:46,999
I attended an interview at a nursing home. Mother helped me pass that interview. But

38
00:03:47,000 --> 00:03:51,999
still, deep in my heart, I had the desire to work in an HSE hospital. My

39
00:03:52,000 --> 00:03:58,999
processing continued for the nursing home. Even then, I kept praying. Just as that process was nearing completion,

40
00:03:59,000 --> 00:04:04,999
suddenly I got a call for an interview from a pediatric hospital —

41
00:04:05,000 --> 00:04:10,999
an HSE hospital. I weighed both options and decided to proceed with the HSE one. Even before

42
00:04:11,000 --> 00:04:16,999
the interview happened, I canceled my plans to go to the nursing home. Everyone blamed me for it. But

43
00:04:17,000 --> 00:04:21,999
still, I had strong faith in Mother Mary — that if it is HSE hospital I truly desire to work in, Mother will grant it.

44
00:04:22,000 --> 00:04:28,999
And just like that, I passed the interview successfully. It was during that time

45
00:04:29,000 --> 00:04:35,999
that I came and took the Covenant. I did it hoping the rest of the processing would move quickly. Around that same time,

46
00:04:36,000 --> 00:04:42,999
my dad was hospitalized. He had a serious heart failure. There was no other option. So,

47
00:04:43,000 --> 00:04:48,999
we admitted him to the hospital at MEMS. The doctor told us there was nothing more that could be done. His heart function

48
00:04:49,000 --> 00:04:54,999
was only 16%. A cardiac arrest could happen anytime. There was nothing more they could do.

49
00:04:55,000 --> 00:04:59,999
They made us sign the DNR (Do Not Resuscitate) consent form. My husband was the one present

50
00:05:00,000 --> 00:05:04,999
at the hospital. He called me and asked, “Should I sign the DNR consent?”

51
00:05:05,000 --> 00:05:09,999
I asked, “Isn’t there any other option? Go ahead and sign it.” But I was sitting outside the hospital with my mom,

52
00:05:10,000 --> 00:05:15,999
praying the Apparition prayer. I was at home that night of the Apparition, staying awake and praying without sleeping.

53
00:05:16,000 --> 00:05:22,999
I had already submitted a candle prayer request and was continuously praying. After seven days,

54
00:05:23,000 --> 00:05:29,999
my dad was peacefully discharged from the hospital. His heart function, which was at 16%,

55
00:05:30,000 --> 00:05:34,999
increased to 24%. That day we made a vow to bring him here and offer a continuous rosary prayer.

56
00:05:35,000 --> 00:05:41,999
So, in October 2022, my dad, I, and our whole family came and took part in the Akhanda Japamala (Unbroken Rosary Prayer).

57
00:05:42,000 --> 00:05:46,999
Since then, dad hasn’t even needed regular check-ups. His heart function is still at 22%,

58
00:05:47,000 --> 00:05:52,999
and he’s been taking medicine regularly. From 2022 till now, he hasn’t had any other health issues. That’s how

59
00:05:53,000 --> 00:05:54,999
Mother Mary blessed us with such a great miracle.

60
00:05:55,000 --> 00:05:59,999
After that Akhanda Japamala, I thought to myself — why haven’t I taken the Covenant yet? After receiving such great blessings from Mother,

61
00:06:00,000 --> 00:06:06,999
we (my dad and I) came on November 12th, 2022, and took the Covenant here. After

62
00:06:07,000 --> 00:06:12,999
taking the Covenant, more challenges began. I applied for my WUS (Workplace upgrade/sponsorship), and it got rejected.

63
00:06:13,000 --> 00:06:18,999
I was extremely upset. I even slightly blamed Mother Mary, wondering — I’ve prayed so much,

64
00:06:19,000 --> 00:06:23,999
and yet why was this one thing rejected? After receiving so many blessings, why did this one thing get rejected? Then my mom

65
00:06:24,000 --> 00:06:28,999
told me, “Never blame Mother Mary. She must have something better in store for you —

66
00:06:29,000 --> 00:06:34,999
maybe that’s why this happened.” So, I came back here and renewed my Covenant and

67
00:06:35,000 --> 00:06:41,999
started praying to Mother Mary again. I began actively engaging in mission activities.

68
00:06:42,000 --> 00:06:46,999
By July, everything was ready for me to go abroad. My approval came through,

69
00:06:47,000 --> 00:06:50,999
and everything was in place — even the ticket was booked. Then my agency called me and said that my OET had expired.

70
00:06:51,000 --> 00:06:56,999
So now I couldn’t go. My DL (Document Letter) had already expired too, and there was nothing else that could be done. The NMBI’s approval

71
00:06:57,000 --> 00:07:01,999
was also not valid anymore. They told me, “Only if you contact them directly, something may work.” I sent

72
00:07:02,000 --> 00:07:07,999
a lot of emails but didn’t get even a single reply. Then, torn between what to do, I prayed to Mother Mary and one evening,

73
00:07:08,000 --> 00:07:12,999
at 5 PM Indian time, I called the NMBI in Ireland. They picked up the call, and I explained my situation. They told me

74
00:07:13,000 --> 00:07:19,999
there was no problem at all — as long as your OET was valid when you wrote the exam and got your PIN number, it remains valid.

75
00:07:20,000 --> 00:07:22,999
At that very moment, I did one thing — I recorded the call while speaking to them.

76
00:07:23,000 --> 00:07:27,999
Technically, such call recordings aren’t allowed. Still, I told the agency about it.

77
00:07:28,000 --> 00:07:31,999
The agency said they needed some proof. So I told them that I had recorded the call.

78
00:07:32,000 --> 00:07:36,999
They told me that recording a call like that isn’t allowed at all — if the authorities found out, it could lead to serious problems.

79
00:07:37,000 --> 00:07:41,999
Even then, I sent that call recording to the agency. After listening to it, they said, “Okay, but we still need something official from them.”

80
00:07:42,000 --> 00:07:48,999
But I didn’t get any official mail or confirmation. Still, I had firm faith in Mother Mary. Because, after so many obstacles,

81
00:07:49,000 --> 00:07:53,999
it was Mother who arranged the job for me — whether it was where I desired or where She desired.

82
00:07:54,000 --> 00:08:01,999
That’s how I finally reached Ireland. This happened after my OET and DL had already expired. Before traveling,

83
00:08:02,000 --> 00:08:07,999
I miraculously received an email from NMBI saying that my OET exam and DL were still valid —

84
00:08:08,000 --> 00:08:14,999
there were no issues. I forwarded that mail to my agency.

85
00:08:15,000 --> 00:08:21,999
Then I went, wrote my exam, got registered as a nurse, and I am now working there. After taking the Covenant,

86
00:08:22,000 --> 00:08:25,999
I was working in Ireland and continuing my prayers regularly.

87
00:08:26,000 --> 00:08:31,999
I hadn’t renewed my Covenant yet, but I used to pray every single day.

88
00:08:32,000 --> 00:08:36,999
In the house I stayed in Ireland, Mother had prepared a huge miracle — the people living there

89
00:08:37,000 --> 00:08:43,999
were from my same hometown, Kannur. Not just that — they were also Covenant-holders who used to

90
00:08:44,000 --> 00:08:45,999
pray the Apparition prayer every day and had taken the Covenant here at Kreupasanam.

91
00:08:46,000 --> 00:08:49,999
That gave me immense joy, because I was blessed with the opportunity to attend church and pray every day.

92
00:08:50,000 --> 00:08:56,999
That’s how my days went by. Then I came back to India on January 1st. Around that time, I noticed

93
00:08:57,000 --> 00:09:01,999
my mom’s stomach seemed a bit swollen. So we went to the hospital for a check-up. During

94
00:09:02,000 --> 00:09:06,999
the scan, the doctor said it might be cancer. I was sitting outside, praying to Mother Mary,

95
00:09:07,000 --> 00:09:11,999
“Mother, please don’t let my mom have cancer. If there’s any illness, give it to me instead.”

96
00:09:12,000 --> 00:09:16,999
That’s how I prayed. During the scan, my mom said she felt as if Mother Mary was right beside her.

97
00:09:17,000 --> 00:09:21,999
I was sitting outside, praying the Creed continuously with full faith. And then,

98
00:09:22,000 --> 00:09:22,999
the doctors confirmed that she had no other issues.

99
00:09:23,000 --> 00:09:25,999
Mother healed her and made everything normal.

100
00:09:26,000 --> 00:09:30,999
After that, I returned to Ireland. From July onwards, I suddenly started experiencing mild breathing difficulty...

101
00:09:31,000 --> 00:09:36,999
I started experiencing chest pain as well. Still, I was really hesitant to go to the hospital.

102
00:09:37,000 --> 00:09:39,999
I continued going to work every day, despite the pain worsening near my duty hours.

103
00:09:40,000 --> 00:09:44,999
I checked my oxygen saturation myself at the hospital — everything seemed normal.

104
00:09:45,000 --> 00:09:48,999
But the next day, after being strongly advised by the hospital staff, I went to our nearby GP.

105
00:09:49,000 --> 00:09:53,999
When the GP examined me, they immediately said, “This is an emergency. You must go to the hospital right away.”

106
00:09:54,000 --> 00:09:57,999
So I went to the hospital, taking my baby along with me — I had no one else to accompany me.

107
00:09:58,000 --> 00:10:01,999
I called my husband, who was on duty, and he rushed over. Once I reached the hospital,

108
00:10:02,000 --> 00:10:06,999
they took an X-ray, and told me that there was fluid accumulating in my lungs — it was pleural effusion.

109
00:10:07,000 --> 00:10:11,999
They said I had to be admitted immediately, and that a tube, called a pigtail, would need to be inserted to drain the fluid.

110
00:10:12,000 --> 00:10:15,999
I was admitted to the hospital. While lying there, I prayed to Mother Mary with all my heart.

111
00:10:16,000 --> 00:10:21,999
I opened my Bible, and the verse that I came across said: “By the grace of God, you are what you are”

112
00:10:22,000 --> 00:10:25,999
Even though I was short of breath, I could still pray. I told my mother about it, and she said,

113
00:10:26,000 --> 00:10:28,999
“Pray just this one thing: ‘Holy Spirit, give me strength today.’”

114
00:10:29,000 --> 00:10:29,999
So I continued to pray sincerely.

115
00:10:30,000 --> 00:10:34,999
After five days, all my blood tests and investigations came back normal. They couldn’t figure out

116
00:10:35,000 --> 00:10:39,999
what the actual issue was. Since everything appeared normal, they discharged me.

117
00:10:40,000 --> 00:10:43,999
When they had inserted the tube, nearly two liters of fluid were drained from my lungs.

118
00:10:44,000 --> 00:10:48,999
The doctor told me, “This is nothing short of a miracle. With so much fluid, you didn’t even have a respiratory arrest.

119
00:10:49,000 --> 00:10:50,999
It’s incredible that your oxygen saturation stayed at 100%.”

120
00:10:51,000 --> 00:10:55,999
I told the doctor something special — “It’s because Mother Mary is beside me, resting close to my chest.

121
00:10:56,000 --> 00:11:00,999
I won’t face any harm, because Mother is with me and she will protect me.”

122
00:11:01,000 --> 00:11:04,999
After I was discharged and came home, I started feeling a slight shortness of breath again.

123
00:11:05,000 --> 00:11:09,999
Everyone knows how difficult it is to get medical treatment in Ireland.

124
00:11:10,000 --> 00:11:14,999
So I decided to return to India on emergency sick leave. As soon as I landed at the airport in India,

125
00:11:15,000 --> 00:11:17,999
I felt breathless again. I went on my own and got an X-ray done — and they found fluid again in my lungs.

126
00:11:18,000 --> 00:11:22,999
The next day, I went to see a pulmonologist at Kannur Medical College.

127
00:11:23,000 --> 00:11:26,999
The doctor did all the investigations, and everything came back normal.

128
00:11:27,000 --> 00:11:32,999
Even though the reports were normal, the doctor said the next step would be to insert a tube into the chest and do a thoracoscopy.

129
00:11:33,000 --> 00:11:38,999
They said it might be TB, and they needed to send a biopsy to confirm, as TB sometimes doesn’t show up just in the fluid test.

130
00:11:39,000 --> 00:11:43,999
So they decided to test the fluid and admit me for further examination.

131
00:11:44,000 --> 00:11:49,999
I returned home. When I got home, my dad told me, “Only after renewing your consecration at the Mount of Grace (Kreupasanam), should you get admitted.”

132
00:11:50,000 --> 00:11:54,999
I told him confidently, “Papa, please don’t worry. I’m sure it’s not cancer. Nothing serious will be found.”

133
00:11:55,000 --> 00:11:59,999
I spoke with such firm faith that I truly believed no serious illness would be diagnosed.

134
00:12:00,000 --> 00:12:06,999
They had told me to get admitted on August 7th, but I went to Kreupasanam on August 6th and renewed my consecration.

135
00:12:07,000 --> 00:12:09,999
I met the priest there and prayed, asking him to bless me so that the root cause of my illness could be found.

136
00:12:10,000 --> 00:12:21,999
The priest laid his hand on my head, anointed my forehead with holy oil, and gave me a blessed medal. I tied it to my dress and began praying continuously.

137
00:12:22,000 --> 00:12:25,999
I returned home and got admitted the next morning.

138
00:12:26,000 --> 00:12:31,999
After admission, they prepared me for the procedure and said, “Earlier there was a lot of fluid, but now it seems reduced.”

139
00:12:32,000 --> 00:12:36,999
I thought to myself, Mother Mary has touched me. The rest of the fluid must have miraculously drained away. I was overjoyed.

140
00:12:37,000 --> 00:12:40,999
As they sedated me, I could still hear them speaking, and I felt reassured.

141
00:12:41,000 --> 00:12:43,999
Still, they inserted an ICD (intercostal drainage) tube to remove fluid.

142
00:12:44,000 --> 00:12:46,999
I suffered intense pain for almost 24 hours. It was extremely difficult,

143
00:12:47,000 --> 00:12:50,999
but I kept praying to Mother Mary and repeated the prayer of consecration again and again.

144
00:12:51,000 --> 00:12:56,999
Later, the doctors said, “Everything looks normal — we couldn’t identify anything specific.”

145
00:12:57,000 --> 00:13:02,999
They decided to do a scan just to be thorough.

146
00:13:03,000 --> 00:13:05,999
During the abdominal scan, they found a small cyst in the abdominal wall.

147
00:13:06,000 --> 00:13:08,999
They said it might be due to rheumatoid arthritis because the results showed a borderline indicator.

148
00:13:09,000 --> 00:13:13,999
Other than that, all the investigations were normal. Still, they said, “Let’s do a biopsy just to be safe.”

149
00:13:14,000 --> 00:13:17,999
So they aspirated the cyst and sent it for biopsy.

150
00:13:18,000 --> 00:13:20,999
I was discharged from the hospital, but two days later, I received a phone call.

151
00:13:21,000 --> 00:13:27,999
The hospital told me I was diagnosed with Stage 4 ovarian cancer — serous carcinoma.

152
00:13:28,000 --> 00:13:34,999
They said this type of cancer spreads quickly throughout the body, which is why I had pleural effusion.

153
00:13:35,000 --> 00:13:38,999
They told me the only treatment option was to begin chemotherapy as soon as possible.

154
00:13:39,000 --> 00:13:44,999
Not only that, but they had already seen signs of the cancer spreading inside the abdomen, including some fluid buildup.

155
00:13:45,000 --> 00:13:50,999
So they said chemotherapy was the only hope.

156
00:13:51,000 --> 00:13:56,999
But even when I heard such a severe diagnosis, I didn’t cry or feel devastated. I didn’t break down.

157
00:13:57,000 --> 00:14:00,999
Mother Mary gave me immense strength. I continued praying to her every single day.

158
00:14:01,000 --> 00:14:03,999
I knew that getting treatment here would cost a lot of money.

159
00:14:04,000 --> 00:14:06,999
At that time, I was thinking about the car loan we had taken in Ireland. That burden was on my mind.

160
00:14:07,000 --> 00:14:11,999
So I decided that I would go back to Ireland, even through the pain from the recent surgery.

161
00:14:12,000 --> 00:14:17,999
I made up my mind to return alone to Ireland.

162
00:14:18,000 --> 00:14:21,999
When I reached the airport, I received another blessing from Mother Mary.

163
00:14:22,000 --> 00:14:28,999
I had booked an economy class ticket, but somehow, it got upgraded to business class.

164
00:14:29,000 --> 00:14:34,999
I don’t know how it happened. With the pain I was in, I couldn’t imagine enduring an 18-hour flight.

165
00:14:35,000 --> 00:14:39,999
I didn’t have the money to pay for a business class ticket,

166
00:14:40,000 --> 00:14:45,999
but Mother Mary knew, and she arranged it for me. I traveled comfortably and safely reached Ireland.

167
00:14:46,000 --> 00:14:49,999
Even before I got there, Mother Mary had already prepared everything.

168
00:14:50,000 --> 00:14:52,999
At a hospital in Ireland, where I knew some people and didn’t know others, everything was arranged.

169
00:14:53,000 --> 00:14:58,999
The very next day, I was able to meet with a doctor and get all the necessary appointments.

170
00:14:59,000 --> 00:15:03,999
I hadn’t brought any biopsy slides with me, but the hospital itself decided to quickly proceed with the necessary steps.

171
00:15:04,000 --> 00:15:07,999
However, in Ireland, getting appointments for CT and MRI scans usually involves long delays.

172
00:15:08,000 --> 00:15:12,999
Without completing those investigations, they couldn’t start treatment.

173
00:15:13,000 --> 00:15:16,999
I prayed to Mother Mary, asking her to show me a way.

174
00:15:17,000 --> 00:15:22,999
There was still fluid in my lungs. I didn’t know what to do if it kept increasing in the coming month.

175
00:15:23,000 --> 00:15:28,999
At that moment, the sister from my hometown — someone I knew well — helped me.

176
00:15:29,000 --> 00:15:33,999
She had worked as a staff nurse in the cancer ward at the very hospital where I was seeking treatment.

177
00:15:34,000 --> 00:15:39,999
She helped me with everything.

178
00:15:40,000 --> 00:15:47,999
She even spoke with the CT scan department and arranged everything directly. Because of her, the CT scan I was scheduled to get in September...

179
00:15:48,000 --> 00:15:52,999
The CT scan that was originally scheduled for September was done by the end of August itself.

180
00:15:53,000 --> 00:15:58,999
After seeing the report, the doctor called me and said that fluid had filled up again, and they would need to insert a tube once more. I had to get admitted.

181
00:15:59,000 --> 00:16:02,999
I went bravely, but the pain from inserting that pigtail tube was truly unbearable.

182
00:16:03,000 --> 00:16:05,999
I prayed to Mother Mary. That day of admission happened to be a Tuesday.

183
00:16:06,000 --> 00:16:09,999
As I walked into the scanning room, I was listening to a Kreupasanam testimony.

184
00:16:10,000 --> 00:16:15,999
Throughout the procedure, I kept listening to that testimony.

185
00:16:16,000 --> 00:16:21,999
At that moment, a nurse came from behind and gently covered me with a blue blanket.

186
00:16:22,000 --> 00:16:27,999
I felt it was a sign, a miracle from Mother Mary — I took that blue color as a symbol of her presence.

187
00:16:28,000 --> 00:16:31,999
They made me so comfortable, and the pigtail insertion didn’t hurt me at all.

188
00:16:32,000 --> 00:16:40,999
Afterwards, they also took a biopsy, and I felt no pain — I didn’t even need a painkiller.

189
00:16:41,000 --> 00:16:46,999
But while I was admitted, there were no beds available, so I had to lie on a stretcher with the tube still inside.

190
00:16:47,000 --> 00:16:50,999
It was extremely uncomfortable and painful. I prayed to Mother Mary again.

191
00:16:51,000 --> 00:16:54,999
One of my friends called me, and I told her how hard it was to stay on that stretcher.

192
00:16:55,000 --> 00:17:00,999
Right then, she went to a nearby Mother Mary's church and prayed for me.

193
00:17:01,000 --> 00:17:05,999
The next morning, I developed a slight cold. They tested me and told me I was COVID positive.

194
00:17:06,000 --> 00:17:09,999
Because of that, they immediately shifted me to an isolation room, and I got a proper bed!

195
00:17:10,000 --> 00:17:14,999
I told the doctor the next day that I was feeling fine and had no other symptoms.

196
00:17:15,000 --> 00:17:22,999
I told the doctor — it was Mother Mary herself who made me COVID positive just so I wouldn’t have to suffer on that stretcher.

197
00:17:23,000 --> 00:17:27,999
The staff even told me: “You’re the first person we’ve ever seen who’s happy about testing positive for COVID!”

198
00:17:28,000 --> 00:17:32,999
After that, all my treatments were completed and the reports came in.

199
00:17:33,000 --> 00:17:35,999
The final diagnosis confirmed: it was indeed serous carcinoma.

200
00:17:36,000 --> 00:17:39,999
My treatment began immediately.

201
00:17:40,000 --> 00:17:42,999
From September onwards, I never missed the Apparition Prayer even a single day.

202
00:17:43,000 --> 00:17:48,999
I would listen to the Online Kreupasanam Covenant Retreats, starting from that July — never missed it even once.

203
00:17:49,000 --> 00:17:51,999
I continued saying the Apparition Prayer daily.

204
00:17:52,000 --> 00:17:57,999
I also prayed the Rosary every day — as much as I could during that time.

205
00:17:58,000 --> 00:18:02,999
Without me even knowing, someone added me to a Kreupasanam prayer group.

206
00:18:03,000 --> 00:18:05,999
Through that group, I received the grace to pray and join the Rosary regularly.

207
00:18:06,000 --> 00:18:08,999
Around that time, I also called my aunty...

208
00:18:09,000 --> 00:18:14,999
My aunty told me, “Always pray to Mother Mary, saying: ‘Kreupasanam Amma, please make me a witness to your apparitions.’”

209
00:18:15,000 --> 00:18:18,999
She asked me to write that prayer down if I could.

210
00:18:19,000 --> 00:18:25,999
So, I started writing that sentence every single day — 33 times a day — and I continued that for 33 days.

211
00:18:26,000 --> 00:18:32,999
After that, I underwent three rounds of chemotherapy, and it was truly a miracle — even the doctors were surprised.

212
00:18:33,000 --> 00:18:35,999
I had no side effects at all during chemo.

213
00:18:36,000 --> 00:18:40,999
I didn’t have to take even a single painkiller. Not even nausea or any other issue.

214
00:18:41,000 --> 00:18:42,999
I remained completely active throughout.

215
00:18:43,000 --> 00:18:47,999
The doctor said, “This is such a miracle! You’re not experiencing even one side effect?”

216
00:18:48,000 --> 00:18:50,999
Even during blood investigations — usually platelets drop during chemo —

217
00:18:51,000 --> 00:18:57,999
but in my case, during every chemo session, my platelet count actually increased.

218
00:18:58,000 --> 00:19:01,999
That’s how I continued treatment.

219
00:19:02,000 --> 00:19:07,999
They did a repeat scan and found everything was normal. So, they decided to take me for surgery.

220
00:19:08,000 --> 00:19:12,999
The doctors told me it would be a very complicated surgery, since the cancer had fully spread in the abdomen.

221
00:19:13,000 --> 00:19:19,999
They said they would have to remove half of the organs and also place a tube for draining fluid.

222
00:19:20,000 --> 00:19:23,999
I got admitted for the surgery — all the follow-ups, I did completely alone.

223
00:19:24,000 --> 00:19:26,999
On the morning of the surgery, I felt very low emotionally.

224
00:19:27,000 --> 00:19:29,999
Because once the tube was placed, I would be dependent on someone else for everything.

225
00:19:30,000 --> 00:19:35,999
That thought was deeply disturbing to me — but I didn’t share this with anyone, not even my family.

226
00:19:36,000 --> 00:19:37,999
I called my aunty and told her what I was feeling.

227
00:19:38,000 --> 00:19:42,999
She replied, “Don’t be sad — Mother Mary and Jesus themselves will come and do the surgery with you.”

228
00:19:43,000 --> 00:19:46,999
I had a deep desire to take my Kreupasanam locket into the operating theatre.

229
00:19:47,000 --> 00:19:50,999
But since it was made of gold, the hospital didn’t allow it.

230
00:19:51,000 --> 00:19:56,999
Once again, Mother Mary intervened. The doctor asked me, “Is there something you’d like to carry inside with you?”

231
00:19:57,000 --> 00:20:02,999
I said yes — and they placed my Kreupasanam covenant token inside a small bottle and allowed me to take it into surgery.

232
00:20:03,000 --> 00:20:04,999
I don’t clearly remember whether it was before or after the surgery,

233
00:20:05,000 --> 00:20:08,999
but at some point, I saw Mother Mary come near me.

234
00:20:09,000 --> 00:20:16,999
After the surgery was over, I told the doctor, “Before the surgery, I had told you — do whatever surgery you need to do. I’m not afraid. Mother Mary is with me.”

235
00:20:17,000 --> 00:20:19,999
Every time I went to the hospital, I used to carry a small Mother Mary statue with me.

236
00:20:20,000 --> 00:20:20,999
The doctor once asked me, “Is this the one you’re praying to — your Mother Mary?”

237
00:20:21,000 --> 00:20:22,999
I said yes.

238
00:20:23,000 --> 00:20:25,999
After the surgery, the doctor shared something with me...

239
00:20:26,000 --> 00:20:30,999
When they performed the laparoscopy, they found that the cancer had not spread anywhere in my abdomen.

240
00:20:31,000 --> 00:20:35,999
They did a total hysterectomy and sent the tissue for biopsy. When the report came back, it showed cancer only in my ovary.

241
00:20:36,000 --> 00:20:41,999
Even the uterus was completely unaffected. I believe Mother Mary gave me a great blessing and protected me.

242
00:20:42,000 --> 00:20:47,999
After that, some problems returned — there was a small fluid buildup in my abdomen.

243
00:20:48,000 --> 00:20:54,999
They said my bladder was damaged during surgery. I continued applying the covenant oil and praying at the cross.

244
00:20:55,000 --> 00:21:01,999
They scanned me again and made everything normal once more. Then I had more chemotherapy, but without any side effects — it was just like receiving a normal injection.

245
00:21:02,000 --> 00:21:06,999
After that, I was preparing to return to work.

246
00:21:07,000 --> 00:21:16,999
But when I started duty again, more problems came up. They said because of the chemo, I needed to change departments.

247
00:21:17,000 --> 00:21:21,999
So I went to the hospital, took some salt from a friend, and prayed there.

248
00:21:22,000 --> 00:21:25,999
I don’t know how, but during that time, the manager went on leave for two weeks.

249
00:21:26,000 --> 00:21:31,999
After the manager returned, I met my occupational health doctor, who told me I didn’t need to change departments because all my blood tests were normal.

250
00:21:32,000 --> 00:21:39,999
Then they told me to take a tablet for two years as a preventive measure.

251
00:21:40,000 --> 00:21:46,999
But I know Mother Mary gave me a huge blessing. I am confident that cancer cells will never come back into my life.

252
00:21:47,000 --> 00:21:59,999
I always prayed to Mother Mary: “Mother, you were with Jesus for 33 years. My children are 3 and 6 years old — please let me be with them until they grow up and can take care of themselves. Bless me.”

253
00:22:00,000 --> 00:22:06,999
I promised I wouldn’t ask for anything else for 33 years. I only want to be with them and not have any illness come to me.

254
00:22:07,000 --> 00:22:13,999
Mother Mary gave me a great blessing and protected me. I never had to change departments.

255
00:22:14,000 --> 00:22:18,999
Last month, I repeated the scans and blood tests. Every time, my hemoglobin and platelet counts are increasing.

256
00:22:19,000 --> 00:22:22,999
My CT scan is now completely normal.

257
00:22:23,000 --> 00:22:27,999
The doctors are extremely happy about my case because such a great miracle has happened.

258
00:22:28,000 --> 00:22:32,999
I have come back home just to share this testimony.

259
00:22:33,000 --> 00:22:38,999
When I went to Ireland with this illness and attended the Nurses Ministry program, there was a brother there...

260
00:22:39,000 --> 00:22:42,999
He had come. I had never seen that brother before, and he had never seen me either.

261
00:22:43,000 --> 00:22:46,999
Then that brother asked me, "You have such an illness, right?" I said, "Yes."

262
00:22:47,000 --> 00:22:54,999
He said, "Don’t worry at all. Mother is blessing you. There is a place called Kreupasanam in Alappuzha. If possible, go there, take a covenant, and pray."

263
00:22:55,000 --> 00:22:58,999
I told him, "I have already taken the covenant at Kreupasanam."

264
00:22:59,000 --> 00:23:02,999
Then the brother said, "It is clear that Mother is blessing you."

265
00:23:03,000 --> 00:23:08,999
Likewise, that Mother had blessed me. Then I also mentioned that I was supposed to testify here on December 31,

266
00:23:09,000 --> 00:23:14,999
but even before December 31, Mother had already blessed me. I had some difficulties coming here,

267
00:23:15,000 --> 00:23:18,999
including some investigations and blood tests. So I told Mother,

268
00:23:19,000 --> 00:23:24,999
"Until I come here and give my testimony, I will write ‘Kreupasanam Amma, make me a witness of your apparition’ thirty-three times every day."

269
00:23:25,000 --> 00:23:31,999
So I kept writing that until I came here, and that is in my book. In this book, I wrote every day.

270
00:23:32,000 --> 00:23:37,999
So when you get sick, don’t lose heart or cry. Be strong and pray to Mother together.

271
00:23:38,000 --> 00:23:46,999
If you repeatedly pray and say John 11:4 aloud, you will surely receive healing.

272
00:23:47,000 --> 00:23:50,999
I am living proof of that. This illness was not meant to kill me, but for the glory of God,

273
00:23:51,000 --> 00:23:58,999
the glory of the Son of God, and the formation of my works of mercy.

274
00:23:59,000 --> 00:24:03,999
Then I said I went to Ireland...

275
00:24:04,000 --> 00:24:07,999
Before going there, I used to visit old age homes, helping bathe the elderly and give them medicines.

276
00:24:08,000 --> 00:24:13,999
Since my childhood, I have loved helping others like this very much.

277
00:24:14,000 --> 00:24:17,999
Ever since I got a job, I have been helping others by sharing a part of my salary.

278
00:24:18,000 --> 00:24:23,999
Even now, I continue doing that, helping those with financial difficulties.

279
00:24:24,000 --> 00:24:26,999
If someone asks me for help, I try my best to assist them no matter what.

280
00:24:27,000 --> 00:24:31,999
I never worry about my own health. If my mother asks me to help someone,

281
00:24:32,000 --> 00:24:37,999
I send money. Mom always helps them. Also, I always share the covenant, meditations, and daily bread with all my friends.

282
00:24:38,000 --> 00:24:43,999
Because of that, a great change happened in my life, and many people started to believe in Mother Kreupasanam,

283
00:24:44,000 --> 00:24:51,999
take the covenant online, and follow her. I give countless thanks to Mother, the Holy Trinity, and the Saints for these great blessings.

284
00:24:52,000 --> 00:24:55,999
From the Sirach book, chapter fifty, verse twenty-two:

285
00:24:56,000 --> 00:25:01,999
Praise God who does great things everywhere; He raises us from birth and deals with us in mercy.

286
00:25:02,000 --> 00:25:09,999
This sister, Jismadon, together with her father,

287
00:25:10,000 --> 00:25:18,999
testifies to the special protection of the Holy Mother, who works great things for the family, thanking Jesus for the health they received.

288
00:25:19,000 --> 00:25:26,999
First, she testified to the recovery of her father’s illness and his heart attack,

289
00:25:27,000 --> 00:25:35,999
then to her success in the OET exam to go to Ireland, and how the obstacles in the process were removed

290
00:25:36,000 --> 00:25:43,999
through the special protection of the Holy Mother, opening the way for going abroad.

291
00:25:44,000 --> 00:25:51,999
Then she testified about the long battle with cancer she endured, and how through the covenant,

292
00:25:52,000 --> 00:25:58,999
proper care, and the use of the prayer books, she obtained complete healing.

293
00:25:59,000 --> 00:26:06,999
While giving this testimony, she also spoke about an illness her mother had and prayed that it should not turn into cancer,

294
00:26:07,000 --> 00:26:15,999
saying, "Mother, please take that away from me."

295
00:26:16,000 --> 00:26:20,999
It also points to a subject about prayer that the daughter prayed for,

296
00:26:21,000 --> 00:26:26,999
and when we pay attention to her testimony, especially the middle part where she talks about her mother’s illness,

297
00:26:27,000 --> 00:26:33,999
she mentions a particular prayer she offered. Later, that prayer itself became a part of her illness.

298
00:26:34,000 --> 00:26:39,999
The daughter realizes that when we are ready to carry burdens,

299
00:26:40,000 --> 00:26:46,999
and approach God's presence willing to endure great suffering, accepting it as part of our sanctification and for the good of the world and others,

300
00:26:47,000 --> 00:26:54,999
sometimes such endurance turns into great suffering for us.

301
00:26:55,000 --> 00:27:04,999
This testimony we heard at the altar is of such a suffering endured by the daughter.

302
00:27:05,000 --> 00:27:11,999
With much hope, she went abroad to work and started the job,

303
00:27:12,000 --> 00:27:19,999
but cancer spread to various organs, first causing fluid in the lungs, then progressing further,

304
00:27:20,000 --> 00:27:25,999
reaching the fourth stage. And when they say fourth stage, it basically means death is near.

305
00:27:26,000 --> 00:27:33,999
Cancer severely affects the whole body, and only hours remain to live.

306
00:27:34,000 --> 00:27:40,999
Accepting this with awareness, she entrusted her life fully to God.

307
00:27:41,000 --> 00:27:49,999
This testimony of a life that triumphed shows how she never let go of her mother,

308
00:27:50,000 --> 00:27:57,999
faithfully keeping her full trust in the covenant with the mother.

309
00:27:58,000 --> 00:28:06,999
She continuously used the covenant items — the oil, the paper money, and the salt —

310
00:28:07,000 --> 00:28:14,999
prayed the apparition prayers 33 times a day for 33 days, writing and praying.

311
00:28:15,000 --> 00:28:21,999
She carried every disaster, and through her mother’s prayers, beyond her own ability and doctors’ medicines,

312
00:28:22,000 --> 00:28:29,999
by God’s grace, she believed she had the power to heal.

313
00:28:30,000 --> 00:28:36,999
Even when her body was deeply immersed in sickness, she believed the healing power came through the Precious Blood of Jesus.

314
00:28:37,000 --> 00:28:47,999
In this long testimony, she repeatedly emphasizes divine interventions, strength, healing, lifting her from suffering,

315
00:28:48,000 --> 00:28:56,999
and holds onto every trial as she constantly prayed to her mother.

316
00:28:57,000 --> 00:29:02,999
She says she continually offered everything to her mother,

317
00:29:03,000 --> 00:29:10,999
and when going into surgery, when asked what to take inside, without hesitation she said she must take the covenant money with her into the operation theater.

318
00:29:11,000 --> 00:29:16,999
She was admitted to have many internal organs removed.

319
00:29:17,000 --> 00:29:30,999
They say during laparoscopy they saw no major issues, only an ovarian cyst. Nothing like they expected.

320
00:29:31,000 --> 00:29:36,999
“This is not what people calculate about their bodies, dear ones.

321
00:29:37,000 --> 00:29:38,999
God prepares and protects us for His plans.

322
00:29:39,000 --> 00:29:47,999
Even when all human plans fail, God always provides us a safe lifespan and blessings.

323
00:29:48,000 --> 00:29:56,999
So no matter who rejects or writes off these things, life in God’s hands will never be rejected.”

324
00:29:57,000 --> 00:30:04,999
We must always be mindful to live the covenant life. This covenant gives us a kind of spiritual courage.

325
00:30:05,000 --> 00:30:13,999
Even if the world writes me off, even if this illness writes me off, even if this job writes me off,

326
00:30:14,000 --> 00:30:20,999
even if all my efforts fail, I will not weaken. I will rise again and praise God.

327
00:30:21,000 --> 00:30:28,999
God has a plan for me there, and that plan is never for destruction but for welfare and a hopeful future.

328
00:30:29,000 --> 00:30:37,999
I believe in that plan. My covenant mother is my traveling companion. She is capable of stopping any cosmic disaster.

329
00:30:38,000 --> 00:30:42,999
Holding her hand, securing my life,

330
00:30:43,000 --> 00:30:50,999
I will cross the paths of this suffering, these tears, this illness, this ongoing series of failures —

331
00:30:51,000 --> 00:30:56,999
this hopeful prayer of the daughter now stands here at this altar as a witness of blessing, a witness of apparition.

332
00:30:57,000 --> 00:31:02,999
She saw her father, prayed, and strengthened him,

333
00:31:03,000 --> 00:31:11,999
and even when her father left her, the daughter had only one hope —

334
00:31:12,000 --> 00:31:19,999
that her covenant mother would soon give her healing and relief,

335
00:31:20,000 --> 00:31:27,999
and would rescue her from any great suffering in life.

336
00:31:28,000 --> 00:31:34,999
This living testimony is shared here at this altar. The daughter thanks the mother and Jesus

337
00:31:35,000 --> 00:31:42,999
for all the goodness, protection, healing, hope, and spiritual courage she received.

338
00:31:43,000 --> 00:31:49,999
If you haven’t subscribed to this YouTube channel yet, please do so now.

339
00:31:50,000 --> 00:31:54,000
Share this video with your friends and become a messenger of the Lord.
